ld do for fun or money.<br /> <br /> Maybe overall it's a test to see if someone is worthy of the embrace or Black spiral dancers set it up as a walk of the spiral, An arm of Pentex trying to further taint the people playing or even watching at home, but real horror is having it all unmasked to find it was just humans doing it for shits and giggles, not some part of a bigger plan","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16927-illithid","name":"Illithid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16927_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}